   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protected areas for the 21st century</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Protected areas for the 21st century</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13E;om mikrograntu je in&#x161;tal&#xE1;cia informa&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch a n&#xE1;u&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch tab&#xFA;&#x13E; v r&#xE1;mci chr&#xE1;nen&#xE9;ho &#xFA;zemia lesoparku Gorica, ktor&#xE9; je najnav&#x161;tevovanej&#x161;&#xED;m rekrea&#x10D;n&#xFD;m miestom Podgorice.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to install informational and educational boards within the protected area of the Gorica Forest Park, which is the most visited recreational place in Podgorica.</narrative>
  </description>
